     "explanation": "Fog is a downstream feeling with many possible upstream causes, so you work both columns at once. The psychobiotic answer is the tempting one because the science is genuinely exciting, but the evidence is early, strain-specific and inconsistently replicated, and reaching for it first means skipping the causes that a simple blood test would find. Four months of fog earns a clinician, not just a supplement.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PUTTING IT TOGETHER</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The route from plate to head</text>\n<circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"300\" r=\"62\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"308\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"18\">FOOD</text>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">what you</text>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">actually eat</text>\n<circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"300\" r=\"62\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.12)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"340\" y=\"308\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-size=\"18\">MICROBES</text>\n<text x=\"340\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">and the gut</text>\n<text x=\"340\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">barrier</text>\n<circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"300\" r=\"62\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"308\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"18\">SIGNALS</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">vagus, hormones,</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">cytokines</text>\n<circle cx=\"760\" cy=\"300\" r=\"62\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"760\" y=\"308\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"18\">BRAIN</text>\n<text x=\"760\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">inflammation and</text>\n<text x=\"760\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">tryptophan supply</text>\n<circle cx=\"970\" cy=\"300\" r=\"62\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"970\" y=\"308\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"18\">CLARITY</text>\n<text x=\"970\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">and mood</text>\n<path d=\"M200 300 L266 300\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<polygon points=\"276,300 262,292 262,308\" fill=\"#888\"/>\n<path d=\"M410 300 L476 300\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<polygon points=\"486,300 472,292 472,308\" fill=\"#888\"/>\n<path d=\"M620 300 L686 300\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<polygon points=\"696,300 682,292 682,308\" fill=\"#888\"/>\n<path d=\"M830 300 L896 300\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<polygon points=\"906,300 892,292 892,308\" fill=\"#888\"/>\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"490\" width=\"460\" height=\"190\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"538\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"22\">WHAT IS SOLID</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">The vagus is mostly afferent</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"612\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Gut serotonin stays peripheral</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"644\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Diet trials show a real effect</text>\n<rect x=\"580\" y=\"490\" width=\"460\" height=\"190\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"810\" y=\"538\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"22\">WHAT IS EARLY</text>\n<text x=\"810\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Specific psychobiotic strains</text>\n<text x=\"810\" y=\"612\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Small samples, hard to blind</text>\n<text x=\"810\" y=\"644\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Human mechanism detail</text>\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"710\" width=\"980\" height=\"140\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"758\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">And fog itself is a symptom, not a cause</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"798\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Change what you can change, test what needs testing</text>\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"875\" width=\"860\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"935\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Plate, microbes, signals, mind.</text>\n</svg>",
      "caption": "The whole chain, with the solid findings separated from the early ones."
     }
